  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "I've refunded the samosas to your Visa ending in 4242. The refund is $6.50, which is the item's price. Refund RF-4000 should appear within 3 to 5 business days.\n\nThe $8.90 late-delivery credit is still on your account. Your butter chicken, biryani, and naan were delivered, so nothing else on this order is being compensated. If anything else comes up with the order, let me know."
  },
